                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "The `Fixes:` tag should be part of the \"commit trailer\":\n\nhttps://git-scm.com/docs/git-interpret-trailers\n\nCan you please put it between the `Change-Id: and `Signed-off-by:` tags? So:\n\n```\nChange-Id: I325a6393eaabfecc08f758dcae417470dde65efb\nFixes: 8836784f1e06 (\"dsp: base: Add encode req & decode resp for MultipartReceive command\")\nSigned-off-by: Chau Ly <chaul@amperecomputing.com>\n```\n\nNote that tags shouldn't be line-wrapped (as this complicates parsing). If you find it fails CI, you can add the following as a trailer as well:\n\n```\ngitlint-ignore: B1\n```\n\nSo:\n\n```\ngitlint-ignore: B1\nChange-Id: I325a6393eaabfecc08f758dcae417470dde65efb\nFixes: 8836784f1e06 (\"dsp: base: Add encode req & decode resp for MultipartReceive command\")\nSigned-off-by: Chau Ly <chaul@amperecomputing.com>\n```"
                },
